ument_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1520435032:0":{"text":"어떻게... 그렇게 많은 비극을 직접...","source_cn":"你怎么会……见过那么多惨剧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EB2A4F9DF1E7CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1520435033:1":{"text":"...좋은 질문이야. 사실 나도 무척 궁금한 부분이거든.","source_cn":"……好问题。说真的，我也很想知道这个问题的答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD8F7CADEF634B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1520435034:0":{"text":"하지만 안타깝게도, 내가 아무리 묻고 또 물어도 신은 대답해 주지 않았어.","source_cn":"可惜，无论如何发问，神都不会回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x272D41E5D2E479DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1520435035:0":{"text":"그것도... 신의 저주를 받은 셈인가요?","source_cn":"这算是……被神明诅咒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97ECC22FE63084F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:46:1520435035":{"text":"그것도... 신의 저주를 받은 셈인가요?","source_cn":"这算是……被神明诅咒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97ECC22FE63084F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1520435036:0":