_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1520435042:0":{"text":"...사실 저, 풍요의 신에게 기근을 멈춰달라고... 아빠랑 엄마를 다시 만나고 싶다고... 기도를 드리려고 했어요.","source_cn":"……我本来想向丰饶神祈祷，想让饥荒停止，想让他把爸爸妈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD98C18A50D8CB95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1520435043:1":{"text":"하지만 마법사님들조차 신의 의지를 바꿀 수 없다면, 역시...","source_cn":"但是，如果连你们都改变不了神的意志，我……果然还是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x924D79E50B4F3976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1520435044:1":{"text":"톨로, 잘 들어요. 마법은 모든 것을 바꿀 수 없지만, 당신의 소원을 들어줄 수는 있어요. 부모님을 다시 만나고 싶다는 거죠?","source_cn":"托洛，听我说。魔法虽然无法改变一切，但可以实现你的愿望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A2D99E072D9563C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1520435045:0":{"text":"맞죠, 모르간?","source_cn":"对吧，摩根？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5DF3A1C53F7194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1520435046:1":{"text":"...지, 진짜요? 제발 아빠랑 엄마를 다시 만나게 해주세요! 한 번, 딱 한 번만이라도 좋으니까, 제발요!","source_cn":"——真、真的吗？求求你们，求求你们让我见见爸爸妈妈吧，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x525FE0E34F3E09A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":""